  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bridge over Zambezi river - Contractor &amp; Engineer</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Bridge over Zambezi river</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Byggande av en bro &#xf6;ver Zambezifloden.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Construction of a permanent bridge across the Zambeze River, linking  the Sofala and Zambezia provinces on the upgraded N1 highway. The     bridge will be 2 340m long with two lanes and sidewalks. Sida         participates in the co-financing of the Caia bridge over the Zambeze  River, with EU, Italy and Japan. The Swedish contribution is about    30% of the calculated costs.</narrative>
  </description>
